DESCRIPTION:"Beloved Gold Coast five-piece Chutney are dusting off their in
 struments and returning to the stage for a massive night of indie rock at 
 Miami Marketta on Saturday\, September 19th. After spending a little too l
 ong away from the stage\, the boys are back and ready to make some noise i
 n one of the Gold Coast’s favourite live music rooms. Joining us for the
  night are local legends Tomorrow’s Forecast and Mermaid Waters\, with o
 ne more very special support act still to be announced! Expect loud guitar
 s\, questionable behaviour\, cold beers and a healthy serving of condiment
  rock."
